iv>\n</div>\n<div class=\"grid-container\">\n<div class=\"maryland-page-alerts margin-top-6\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"views-element-container\" id=\"block-maryland-views-block-local-alerts-site-wide\">\n<div><div class=\"js-view-dom-id-aa8444e5ef54bda7c7e75a806a4603d9da254c565e900b6544f19aaa1e75852f\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"views-element-container\" id=\"block-maryland-views-block-local-alerts-page-specific\">\n<div><div class=\"js-view-dom-id-9948ca733ab775ab3fc3795959e234739030d0daa492f43d2f67ccf4f5111bc7\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"grid-container\">\n<div class=\"grid-row grid-gap\">\n<aside class=\"layout-sidebar-first grid-col-12 desktop:grid-col-3 margin-top-8 desktop:margin-top-10 desktop:margin-bottom-15\" role=\"complementary\">\n<a class=\"usa-skipnav maryland-link maryland-link--skipnav\" href=\"#page-content\">Skip sidebar navigation</a>\n<nav aria-labelledby=\"sidenav-title\" class=\"maryland-sidenav\">\n<button aria-controls=\"sidenav\" class=\"maryland-sidenav__toggle\" type=\"button\">\n<span class=\"usa-sr-only\">Close</span>\n<h2 class=\"maryland-sidenav__title\" id=\"sidenav-title\">Section Menu</h2>\n</button>\n<ul class=\"maryland-sidenav__list maryland-sidenav__list--level-1\" data-region=\"sidebar_first\" id=\"sidenav\">\n<li class=\"maryland-sidenav__item maryland-sidenav__item--level-1\">\n<a class=\"maryland-sidenav__link maryland-sidenav__link--level-1\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/748\" href=\"/funding/african-american-heritage-preservation-program-grants\">African American Heritage Preservation Program Grants</a>\n<ul class=\"maryland-sidenav__list maryland-sidenav__list--level-2\" data-region=\"sidebar_first\">\n<li class=\"maryland-sidenav__item maryland-sidenav__item--level-2\">\n<a class=\"maryland-sidenav__link maryland-sidenav__link--level-2\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/752\" href=\"/funding/african-american-heritage-preservation-program-grants/aahpp-capital-grants\">AAHPP Capital Grants</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"maryland-sidenav__item maryland-sidenav__item--level-2\">\n<span aria-current=\"page\" class=\"maryland-sidenav__link maryland-sidenav__link--level-2\">AAHPP Non-Capital Grants</span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n</aside>\n<div class=\"margin-y-8 desktop:margin-top-10 desktop:margin-bottom-15 grid-col-12 desktop:grid-col-8\" id=\"page-content\">\n<div>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"summary-box\" class=\"maryland-summary-box\" role=\"region\">\n<div class=\"maryland-summary-box__inner\">\n<h2 class=\"maryland-summary-box__heading\" id=\"summary-box\">\n          Applications now open for FY27 grant round!\n        </h2>\n<div class=\"maryland-summary-box__text\">\n<ul class=\"maryland-summary-box__list\">\n<li><p>Applicants should review grant guidelines, watch the general overview webinar, and contact program staff with questions. </p></li>\n<li><p>Start a new application as an <a class=\"maryland-link\" href=\"https://bbgm-apply.yourcausegrants.com/apply/programs/16768e92-7438-4af4-add6-c2a989e9482d\">individual</a> or an <a class=\"maryland-link\" href=\"https://bbgm-apply.yourcausegrants.com/apply/programs/f72f1094-5a57-49e6-988d-17317ca894cc\">organization</a>. <em>Please note,</em> <em>clicking these links will start a new application each time. For help creating a new account, visit the </em><a class=\"maryland-link\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\" data-entity-type=\"node\" data-entity-uuid=\"77d3f678-fd93-4166-a13b-806264a60617\" href=\"/funding/how-apply-grant\" title=\"How to Apply for a Grant\"><em>How to Apply for a Grant</em></a><em> page. </em></p></li>\n<li><p>Access or continue an existing application by logging into your <a class=\"maryland-link\" href=\"https://bbgm-apply.yourcausegrants.com/apply/auth/signin\">grant portal</a> account. <strong>Applications close on November 20, 2026 at 11:59 PM.</strong></p></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"usa-prose maryland-toc-target\">\n<p>The Speaker Adrienne A. Jones African American Heritage Preservation Program (AAHPP) non-capital grants provide <strong>$250,000</strong> to support staffing, planning, and programming at African American museums and historic sites across Maryland. </p><p>The program is jointly administered by the Maryland Historical Trust (MHT) and the Maryland Commission on African American History and Culture (MCAAHC).  </p><h2>Timeline  </h2><ul type=\"disc\"><li>Application opens: early October </li><li>Application deadline: mid-November </li><li>Awards announced: March </li></ul><p>Applicants are strongly encouraged to contact MHT or MCAAHC staff early in project planning for guidance.   </p><h2>Eligible applicants  </h2><ul type=\"disc\"><li>Nonprofit organizations </li><li>Local governments </li><li>Businesses </li><li>Individuals  </li></ul><h2>Eligible projects  </h2><p>Projects must:  </p><ul type=\"disc\"><li>Be located in Maryland  </li><li>Demonstrate a clear, direct connection to African American history, culture, or heritage   </li></ul><p>These <strong>non</strong>-<strong>capital grants</strong> can be used to:  </p><ul type=\"disc\"><li>Hire staff or consultants to preserve and protect ​heritage sites    </li><li>Create plans to guide heritage site management and preservation   </li><li>Launch community programs through education, storytelling, and the arts to connect people with culture  </li></ul><p>Grant funds <strong>cannot </strong>pay for routine maintenance, fundraising expenses, clergy and janitorial staff, or work that has already started or been finished. See the grant guidelines for a longer list of eligible and ineligible costs.   </p><h2>Available funding  </h2><ul type=\"disc\"><li>Applicants may request <strong>up to $50,000</strong> in funding. </li><li>A <strong>match is not required</strong>.  </li></ul><h2>How to apply  </h2><ol type=\"1\"><li>Review the current grant guidelines. </li><li>Confirm applicant and project eligibility. </li><li>Watch the application webinar. </li><li>Prepare required attachments such as cost estimates, photographs, and letters of support. </li><li>Submit a completed application through the <a class=\"maryland-link\" href=\"https://mht.maryland.gov/funding/how-apply-grant\">grants portal</a> before the posted deadline.  </li></ol>\n<section aria-labelledby=\"link-collection\" class=\"maryland-link-collection\">\n<div class=\"maryland-link-collection__container\">\n<div class=\"maryland-link-collection__header\">\n<h2 class=\"maryland-link-collection__title\" id=\"link-collection\"><span>Guidelines &amp; documents for applicants</span>\n</h2>\n<div class=\"maryland-link-collection__header-bottom\">\n<div class=\"maryland-link-collection__description\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<ul class=\"maryland-link-collection__list\">\n<li class=\"maryland-link-collection__item\">\n<a aria-label=\"Grant guidelines (download)\" class=\"maryland-link-collection__link\" href=\"/media/690\">\n<div class=\"maryland-link-collection__link-top\">\n<h3 class=\"maryland-link-collection__link-text\">\n                  Grant guidelines\n                </h3>\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"maryland-link-collection__icon maryland-link-collection__icon--download\"></span>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"maryland-link-collection__item\">\n<a aria-label=\"Grant budget template (download)\" class=\"maryland-link-collection__link\" href=\"/media/692\">\n<div class=\"maryland-link-collection__link-top\">\n<h3 class=\"maryland-link-collection__link-text\">\n                  Grant budget template\n                </h3>\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"maryland-link-collection__icon maryland-link-collection__icon--download\"></span>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"maryland-link-collection__item\">\n<a aria-label=\"Operating budget template (download)\" class=\"maryland-link-collection__link\" href=\"/media/691\">\n<div class=\"maryland-link-collection__link-top\">\n<h3 class=\"maryland-link-collection__link-text\">\n                  Operating budget template\n                </h3>\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"maryland-link-collection__icon maryland-link-collection__icon--download\"></span>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section aria-labelledby=\"link-collection--2\" class=\"maryland-link-collection\">\n<div class=\"maryland-link-collection__container\">\n<div class=\"maryland-link-collection__header\">\n<h2 class=\"maryland-link-collection__title\" id=\"link-collection--2\"><span>Technical assistance</span>\n</h2>\n<div class=\"maryland-link-collection__header-bottom\">\n<div class=\"maryland-link-collection__description\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<ul class=\"maryland-link-collection__list\">\n<li class=\"maryland-link-collection__item\">\n<a aria-label=\"Overview webinar slides (download)\" class=\"maryland-link-collection__link\" href=\"/media/694\">\n<div class=\"maryland-link-collection__link-top\">\n<h3 class=\"maryland-link-collection__link-text\">\n                  Overview webinar slides\n                </h3>\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"maryland-link-collection__icon maryland-link-collection__icon--download\"></span>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"maryland-link-collection__item\">\n<a aria-label=\"MHT webinar recordings (external link)\" class=\"maryland-link-collection__link\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLT-8TFJ9nGFytn5er2PgAW-HR4eTi-uts\">\n<div class=\"maryland-link-collection__link-top\">\n<h3 class=\"maryland-link-collection__link-text\">\n                  MHT webinar recordings\n                </h3>\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"maryland-link-collection__icon maryland-link-collection__icon--external\"></span>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section aria-labelledby=\"automatic-list-743\" class=\"maryland-automatic-list\">\n<div class=\"maryland-card-group__header\">\n<div class=\"maryland-card-group__header-content\">\n<h2 class=\"maryland-card-group__title visua